    <!-- Terms & Conditions Text -->
    <string name="terms_and_conditions_full_text">
        Welcome to HireMyDriver. By using our platform, you agree to the following terms and conditions:\n\n
        1. SCOPE OF SERVICE\n
        HireMyDriver is a marketplace platform that connects independent drivers with customers. We do not provide transportation services ourselves and are not responsible for the conduct of drivers or passengers.\n\n
        2. CASH-ONLY PAYMENTS\n
        All payments for driving services must be made in CASH directly to the driver upon completion of the trip. HireMyDriver does not handle financial transactions between users and is not liable for payment disputes.\n\n
        3. USER RESPONSIBILITIES\n
        Users must provide accurate personal and contact information. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account.\n\n
        4. SAFETY &amp; CONDUCT\n
        Users and drivers must treat each other with respect. The Emergency Alert feature should only be used in life-threatening situations. Illegal activities during a trip will result in permanent account termination.\n\n
        5. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\n
        HireMyDriver is not liable for any damages, accidents, injuries, or losses resulting from the use of our platform or the services provided by drivers.\n\n
        6. CANCELLATIONS\n
        Repeated cancellations of booked trips may lead to account suspension to ensure a reliable experience for all community members.\n\n
        7. DATA PRIVACY\n
        Your location and personal data are handled according to our Privacy Policy to facilitate safe and efficient trip management.
    </string>

    <!-- Privacy Policy Text -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_full_text">
        At HireMyDriver, we value your privacy. This policy explains how we collect and protect your data:\n\n
        1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT\n
        We collect personal information you provide (name, email, phone number) and location data when you use the app to book or provide driving services.\n\n
        2. HOW WE USE LOCATION DATA\n
        To provide our core service, we collect precise location data to match you with nearby drivers and track your trip progress in real-time. This is essential for safety and service quality.\n\n
        3. DATA SHARING\n
        When a booking is confirmed, your name and pickup location are shared with the driver. In an emergency, your location is shared with your designated contact.\n\n
        4. DATA SECURITY\n
        We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access or disclosure.\n\n
        5. DATA RETENTION\n
        We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you with our services and maintain trip records for safety audits.\n\n
        6. YOUR RIGHTS\n
        You can update your profile or delete your account at any time through the app settings.
    </string>

